                "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme “Training Program for A-HELP Women Workers” is implemented by the Uttarakhand Livestock Development Board (ULDB) under the Department of Animal Husbandry, Government of Uttarakhand. The scheme aims to provide community-service-based skill development and employment opportunities for women in the field of animal husbandry.\n<br>\n\n",
